    <p>Holistic Impact Hub (A.H.I.H) is a non-profit association registered in Burundi under Ministerial Ordinance N°530/1548 of 30 May 2025, issued by the Ministry of the Interior, Community Development and Public Security. This policy explains what personal information we collect through holisticimpacthub.org, how we use it, and the choices you have.</p>

    <h2>Information we collect</h2>
    <ul>
      <li><strong>Contact form:</strong> your name, email address, subject and message.</li>
      <li><strong>Newsletter sign-up:</strong> your email address.</li>
      <li><strong>Emails you send us:</strong> the content of your message and your email address.</li>
      <li><strong>Basic technical data:</strong> standard server logs kept by our website host (such as IP address, browser type and pages visited) for security and reliability.</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>How we use it</h2>
    <ul>
      <li>To reply to your questions and requests.</li>
      <li>To send our newsletter and updates, only if you subscribed.</li>
      <li>To manage partnerships, volunteering and donations.</li>
      <li>To keep the website secure and working.</li>
    </ul>
    <p>We do not sell or rent your personal information. We share it only with service providers that help us run the website and email (for example our website host and Google Workspace), and where the law requires it.</p>

    <h2>Cookies and advertising</h2>
    <p>Our website does not use cookies to track you for advertising. If you arrive from a Google or LinkedIn advertisement, those platforms may record that visit under their own privacy policies.</p>

    <h2>Keeping and protecting your data</h2>
    <p>We keep information only as long as needed for the purpose it was collected. The site is served over HTTPS, and access to our mailboxes is restricted to authorised team members.</p>

    <h2>Your choices</h2>
    <p>You may ask us to access, correct or delete your personal information, or unsubscribe from the newsletter at any time, by writing to <a href="mailto:info@holisticimpacthub.org">info@holisticimpacthub.org</a>.</p>

    <h2>Children</h2>
    <p>This website is not directed at children under 13, and we do not knowingly collect their information.</p>

    <h2>Changes</h2>
    <p>We may update this policy and will change the date above when we do.</p>

